# Build output and editor caches stay out of the build context. Copying them slows the build,
# and a stale class could replace one this build produced.
# The launcher jar's bundled copy of this directory excludes the same set; keep the two in step
# (the resourceGenerators task in the repository root's build.sbt).
# Each pattern starts with `**/` because a bare name matches only at the context root, and sbt
# writes .bsp under app/.
**/target
**/project/project
**/.bsp
**/.scala-build
**/.bloop
**/.metals
**/metals.sbt
**/.DS_Store
